The port includes upstream frontend rendering, shared client/protocol/schema
code, utilities, assets, and dependency patches. It does not include the
OpenCode backend, core, CLI, or managed sidecar. Package-level provenance is
recorded in docs/upstream.json in the source repository.

Changes made by this project include the browser plugin SDK and host, the thin
Electron desktop shell, service project discovery, and optional project tab
